"Manaweaving Without Drawing": {
  "index": 5,
  "category": "manaweaving",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Manaweave Projectors"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "If I'm either unwilling or unable to draw manaweave patterns manually, I can craft a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Manaweave Projector",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nThese devices, when placed, will draw mana from wizards within 2 blocks. When full, it will have drawn in "
        },
        {
          "text": "100 mana",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nActivating the block when full will cause it to emit the current pattern. \n\nActivating the block with a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Manaweave Pattern Item",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " will change the pattern that is emitted.  These can be obtained by "
        },
        {
          "text": "exploring",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " or by trading with "
        },
        {
          "text": "Manaweaver Villagers",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Bottled Manaweaves"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Once drawn and in the world, I can "
        },
        {
          "text": "bottle",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " a "
        },
        {
          "text": "manaweave pattern",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " by activating it with a plain bottle in my hand. \n\nI can then "
        },
        {
          "text": "throw it like a potion",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " or a snowball, and it will release the manaweave where it lands. \n\nI can "
        },
        {
          "text": "bottle manaweaves directly into a bottle",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " sitting on a "
        },
        {
          "text": "pedestal",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " if they're drawn nearby. \n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Setting up a construct",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " to place empty bottles, activate a projector charged by one or more mana pylons, then remove the captured manaweave in a bottle and place it in some kind of storage container sounds like a "
        },
        {
          "text": "good way to automate",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " this process."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
